---
description: >-
  Label markup (D710, D711). Plain labels draw <br>, the tags and entities
  and draw other tags as written text (#1440); a label in "`…`" is a
  markdown string; markdown syntax outside one, a label in backticks without
  the quotes (#1368) and List<T> stay as written.
---
timeline
  title Label <b>markup</b>
